    "Id": "mechdef_temax_cat_ninjabolt_TMC-NB",
    "Name": "Temax Cat Ninjabolt TMC-NB",
    "Details": "The 'Mech is armed with an ER large laser in the right arm of a Ninja-To. In the left arm, taken from an old Catapult, the 'Mech mounts an Enhanced LRM-15 Launcher with a ton of ammo in the left torso. The 'Mech's right torso is equipped with a class 10 hyper-velocity autocannon with a ton of ammo. The Temax retains a single medium laser from its days as an Axman, now mounted in its left torso. The 'Mech retains the same jump jets as it did as the Axman. The Temax has 12 tons of standard armor protecting its hull, but the protection is uneven due to the differences in donor 'Mech armor protection. The 'Mech employs 10 Double Heat Sinks to manage the heat.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Intimidating</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_temaxcatninjabolt"
  },
